  "modelScope": "Sampled terminal reason, incarnation, floating geometry and live source-space model; nine explicitly selected named tests and nine reachable witnesses, 1000 traces/30 steps. Native event delivery, layout/float precision, clipping, device/lock/output loss, tiled/fullscreen/MAX/snap and AT are not modeled or accepted. Original properties remain unchanged. No exhaustive proof.",
