    "Release": "Default synchronous release path retains original drop/group behavior.",
    "EscapePress": "CKeybindManager::onKeyEvent scopes Cancel; dragEnd restores live captured source space and floating box, no drop/focus.",
    "EscapeRelease": "Existing exact press predicate never ends the next gesture on old Escape release.",
    "CloseOwner": "CWindow::unmapWindow scopes Retire on exact current drag target window before observers and held-button release.",
    "Reopen": "Original serial is consumed and cannot start a replacement native incarnation.",
